ion":"XQTUM is a prototype for art on an Ethereum-based blockchain generated from quantum computation.  The inputs can be message based while the output is unpredictable.  The quantum computation is run in AWS Braket. ","topics":[],"score":2186,"global_rank":209089},{"name":"deboboy/desearch","owner":"deboboy","html_url":"https://github.com/deboboy/desearch","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":1,"language":null,"description":"Desearch is a prototype for modeling discovery for decentralized entities.  These entities generally don't have a linkable resource, i.e. URI or similar; which makes crawling, indexing challenging.","topics":[],"score":2186,"global_rank":209090},{"name":"deboboy/taurus","owner":"deboboy","html_url":"https://github.com/deboboy/taurus","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Taurus is a framework for fractionalizing digital art on an Ethereum based blockchain. The code in this repo creates an API for the framework; to run it as a service. The API has endpoints for creating galleries, then artwork, then members who can claim galleries and add their artwork. ","topics":["art","blockchain"],"score":2186,"global_rank":209091},{"name":"ChrisDryden/DriveTestScraper","owner":"ChrisDryden","html_url":"https://github.com/ChrisDryden/DriveTestScraper","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":null,"description":"Automates searching DriveTest bookings to find cancelled slots ","topics":[],"score":2186,"global_rank":209092}]